project TodoWeb
target webServer
runtime native 1
module app.todo_web

webServer todoWebServer
purpose operation todoWebServer "Serve the Todo Web HTTP interface on localhost with a single hello route"
serverHost todoWebServer "127.0.0.1"
serverPort todoWebServer 18080
route todoWebServer GET "/" helloTodoWebHandler
routeTimeoutOptOut todoWebServer "/" "single fixed response; no per-route timeout budget needed"
routeMiddlewareOptOut todoWebServer "/" "single fixed response; no middleware needed"

capability httpResponseWriter http.response write
purpose operation httpResponseWriter "Authority to write the root HTTP response"

operation helloTodoWebHandler
input operation helloTodoWebHandler request HttpRequest
input operation helloTodoWebHandler response HttpResponse
output operation helloTodoWebHandler CSignedInt32
effect helloTodoWebHandler write http.response
memory helloTodoWebHandler arena request
async helloTodoWebHandler no
useCapability helloTodoWebHandler httpResponseWriter
purpose operation helloTodoWebHandler "Return a plain hello response for the Todo Web root route"
invariant operation helloTodoWebHandler "Every successful request writes exactly one text response"

label startHelloTodoWebHandler

storage module immutable helloStatusCode CSignedInt32 200
storage module immutable helloBody CNullTerminatedByteString "hello from todo web\n"

call writeHelloResponseCall http.responseText
argument writeHelloResponseCall response HttpResponse response
argument writeHelloResponseCall status CSignedInt32 helloStatusCode
argument writeHelloResponseCall body CNullTerminatedByteString helloBody
run writeHelloResponseCall
bind value writeHelloResponseStatus CSignedInt32 writeHelloResponseCall
return value writeHelloResponseStatus
